"The file builds strings by joining fragments, which is one way obfuscated "
"code hides text. Minifiers and template libraries do the same thing for "
"ordinary reasons."
msgstr ""
"The file builds strings by joining fragments, which is one way obfuscated "
"code hides text. Minifiers and template libraries do the same thing for "
"ordinary reasons."

