msgid ""
"Largest single file the analyzer will parse. Parsing runs on this browser "
"tab’s main thread, so a very large chunk stalls the UI. Raising this above "
"5 also runs into the analyzer failing outright on the largest DHIS2 bundle."
msgstr ""
