msgstr "Minimum Encoded Literal Length"

msgid ""
"Encoded-literal findings shorter than this are not reported. The analyzer "
"scores short ordinary strings — i18n event names, DHIS2 error codes like "
"\"E7113\" — as candidate base64. Set to 0 to report every one."
msgstr ""
"Encoded-literal findings shorter than this are not reported. The analyzer "
"scores short ordinary strings — i18n event names, DHIS2 error codes like "
"\"E7113\" — as candidate base64. Set to 0 to report every one."

