msgctxt "Application title"
msgid "__MANIFEST_APP_TITLE"
msgstr "Security Auditor"

msgctxt "Application description"
msgid "__MANIFEST_APP_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Read-only security auditing for a DHIS2 instance. Intended for system "
"administrators and security reviewers.\n"
"\n"
"**DHIS2 Audit** — checks instance configuration, user accounts, roles and "
"authorities, and HTTP response headers. Surfaces common misconfigurations: "
"weak password policies, over-privileged roles, dormant accounts, missing "
"security headers and unsafe CORS settings.\n"
"\n"
"**Apps Audit** — downloads the JavaScript of every installed app, analyses "
"it locally for obfuscated or otherwise suspicious code, matches "
"dependencies against Retire.js vulnerability signatures, and compares file "
"hashes against a recorded integrity baseline to detect app code that "
"changed without a version change.\n"
"\n"
"Both audits run entirely in the browser using the current user's session — "
"no instance data is sent anywhere. Findings can be exported as a "
"self-contained HTML report.\n"
"\n"
"Requires DHIS2 v40+ and the `ALL` or `F_SYSTEM_SETTING` authority. HTTPS is "
"required for the Apps Audit integrity baseline (Web Crypto is only "
"available in a secure context)."
